Write an executable CommonJS node:test suite for compareSemver. Import it from './semver.cjs'. Return only JavaScript, optionally fenced. Cover every invariant, examples, both orders and equal-precedence inputs. Include your own cases using core numbers 22, 32 and prerelease identifiers beta.22, beta.32.
Specification:
{"version":"lyo.spec.v1","specId":"semver-compare-1","signatures":["compareSemver(a: string, b: string): -1 | 0 | 1"],"invariants":["Precedence is determined first by major, then minor, then patch, compared numerically","A version with a prerelease has lower precedence than the same version without one","Prerelease identifiers are compared left to right: numeric identifiers compare numerically, alphanumeric identifiers compare lexically in ASCII order","A numeric prerelease identifier always has lower precedence than an alphanumeric one","A prerelease with fewer identifiers has lower precedence than one with more, when all preceding identifiers are equal","Build metadata (after '+') is ignored for precedence","compareSemver(a, b) === -compareSemver(b, a) for all valid inputs","compareSemver(a, a) === 0 for all valid inputs"],"constraints":["JavaScript for Node.js, single file named semver.js","CommonJS module exporting compareSemver as a named property of module.exports","Pure function, no I/O, no dependencies","Inputs are always valid semver strings; no validation required"],"examples":[{"input":"compareSemver('1.2.3', '1.2.4')","output":"-1"},{"input":"compareSemver('2.0.0', '10.0.0')","output":"-1","note":"numeric, not lexical, comparison"},{"input":"compareSemver('1.0.0-alpha', '1.0.0')","output":"-1"},{"input":"compareSemver('1.0.0-alpha', '1.0.0-alpha.1')","output":"-1","note":"fewer identifiers is lower"},{"input":"compareSemver('1.0.0-alpha.1', '1.0.0-alpha.beta')","output":"-1","note":"numeric identifier is lower than alphanumeric"},{"input":"compareSemver('1.0.0-beta.2', '1.0.0-beta.11')","output":"-1","note":"numeric prerelease identifiers compare numerically, so 2 < 11"},{"input":"compareSemver('1.0.0-rc.1', '1.0.0')","output":"-1"},{"input":"compareSemver('1.0.0+build.5', '1.0.0')","output":"0","note":"build metadata ignored"}],"edgeCaseHints":["Multi-digit numeric identifiers in prerelease (beta.2 vs beta.11)","Mixed numeric and alphanumeric prerelease identifiers","Prerelease chains of different lengths","Build metadata on versions with and without prerelease","Major/minor/patch values with multiple digits"]}

